u.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/57834543_gY3QHMMNB29OYEa.png\n\n衣装の参考：\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EX1Q-WeXQAMKmG9?format=jpg&name=small\n\nネックレスをゴールドのクロスネックレスに変えてください！\n\nコンセプト\n私のOCはかわいいけど、実は邪悪でクレイジーな殺人鬼なので、ダークでエッジの効いた作品がクールだと思います。肉の切り身とか？世界はあなたのもの\n\n友達にファリンに似てるって言われたので、似てるのは大歓迎です(笑)", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@29_kyuu/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1745125, "client_id": 615772, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ea1561e/uploads/origins/a0246f6a-2119-4fa7-9c89-5a98da82ab07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2556d592a2c663e528b2fbe80faeb410", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ea1561e/uploads/origins/a0246f6a-2119-4fa7-9c89-5a98da82ab07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2556d592a2c663e528b2fbe80faeb410, https://si.imgix.net/3ea1561e/uploads/origins/a0246f6a-2119-4fa7-9c89-5a98da82ab07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a182895eba0a777e73b57726de9d5402 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ea1561e/uploads/origins/a0246f6a-2119-4fa7-9c89-5a98da82ab07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81bf7ec1be8f0cc142ce1376da5c0ddd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ea1561e/uploads/origins/a0246f6a-2119-4fa7-9c89-5a98da82ab07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=847935d5d9dd0f49470a43f6398126f8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ea1561e/uploads/origins/a0246f6a-2119-4fa7-9c89-5a98da82ab07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=847935d5d9dd0f49470a43f6398126f8, https://si.imgix.net/3ea1561e/uploads/origins/a0246f6a-2119-4fa7-9c89-5a98da82ab07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccom